Y | Central Console</span></a><a class="modelimgviewimg" title="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Central Console" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/25.html"><img class="galprev" alt="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Central Console" data-src="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/gallery_3.jpg?1654964625"></a></div><div class="modelimgviewmj" itemprop="image" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><a itemprop="contentUrl" class="modelimgviewimg" href="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/2560x1440/2023_nissan_altima_26_2560x1440.jpg" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><span itemprop="caption">Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Detail</span></a><a class="modelimgviewimg" title="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Detail" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/26.html"><img class="galprev" alt="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Detail" data-src="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/gallery_3.jpg?1654964625"></a></div><div class="modelimgviewmj" itemprop="image" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><a itemprop="contentUrl" class="modelimgviewimg" href="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/2560x1440/2023_nissan_altima_27_2560x1440.jpg" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><span itemprop="caption">Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Detail</span></a><a class="modelimgviewimg" title="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Detail" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/27.html"><img class="galprev" alt="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Detail" data-src="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/gallery_3.jpg?1654964625"></a></div><div class="modelimgviewmj" itemprop="image" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><a itemprop="contentUrl" class="modelimgviewimg" href="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/2560x1440/2023_nissan_altima_28_2560x1440.jpg" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><span itemprop="caption">Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior</span></a><a class="modelimgviewimg" title="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/28.html"><img class="galprev" alt="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior" data-src="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/gallery_3.jpg?1654964625"></a></div><div class="modelimgviewmj" itemprop="image" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><a itemprop="contentUrl" class="modelimgviewimg" href="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/2560x1440/2023_nissan_altima_29_2560x1440.jpg" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><span itemprop="caption">Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Seats</span></a><a class="modelimgviewimg" title="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Seats" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/29.html"><img class="galprev" alt="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Seats" data-src="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/gallery_3.jpg?1654964625"></a></div><div class="modelimgviewmj" itemprop="image" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><a itemprop="contentUrl" class="modelimgviewimg" href="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/2560x1440/2023_nissan_altima_30_2560x1440.jpg" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><span itemprop="caption">Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Front Seats</span></a><a class="modelimgviewimg" title="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Front Seats" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/30.html"><img class="galprev" alt="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Front Seats" data-src="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/gallery_3.jpg?1654964625"></a></div><div class="modelimgviewmj" itemprop="image" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><a itemprop="contentUrl" class="modelimgviewimg" href="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/2560x1440/2023_nissan_altima_31_2560x1440.jpg" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><span itemprop="caption">Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Rear Seats</span></a><a class="modelimgviewimg" title="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Rear Seats" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/31.html"><img class="galprev" alt="Nissan Altima | 2023MY | Interior, Rear Seats" data-src="https://images.caricos.com/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/images/gallery_3.jpg?1654964625"></a></div></div></div></div>			<script>
				$(document).ready(function () {
					function loadgal(){
						var p;
						var pprev;
						var pnext;
						var divcont = "";
						if(window.location.hash) {
							p = window.location.hash.substring(1);
							if((p < 1) || (p > 3) || (p == 'mc')){
								p = 1;
							}
						}
						else{
							p = 1;
						}
						
						$('.bgc5').attr("class", "p1");
						$('#pgn'+p).attr("class", "bgc5");

						if(p > 1){
							pprev = Number(p) - Number(1);
							$('#pgnprev').attr("href", "https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/#"+pprev);
							$('#pgnprev').attr("class", "prevnext prev pna");
						}
						else if(p == 'videos'){
							pprev = 3;
							$('#pgnprev').attr("href", "https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/#"+pprev);
							$('#pgnprev').attr("class", "prevnext prev pna");
						}
						else{
							$('#pgnprev').attr("href", "https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/#"+p);
							$('#pgnprev').attr("class", "prevnext prev off");
						}
						
						if(p < 3){
							pnext = Number(p) + Number(1);
							$('#pgnnext').attr("href", "https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/#"+pnext);
							$('#pgnnext').attr("class", "prevnext next pna");
						}
						else if(p == 3){
							if(false){
								pnext = "videos";
								$('#pgnnext').attr("href", "https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/#"+pnext);
								$('#pgnnext').attr("class", "prevnext next pna");
							}
							else{
								$('#pgnnext').attr("href", "https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/#"+p);
								$('#pgnnext').attr("class", "prevnext next off");
							}
						}
						else{
							if(p == 'videos'){
								$('#pgnnext').attr("href", "https://www.caricos.com/cars/n/nissan/2023_nissan_altima/#"+p);
								$('#pgnnext').attr("class", "prevnext next off");
							}
						}
						
						if(p == 'videos'){
							var poffset = 3*100;
							$('#galmj').css("left", "-" + poffset + "%");
						}
						else{
							var poffset = (p-1)*100;
							$('#galmj').css("left", "-" + poffset + "%");
						}
						
						$("#galpage" + p + ", #galpage" + pprev + ", #galpage" + pnext).find("img").each(function(){
							var src = $(this).attr("data-src");
							$(this).attr("src", src);
							$(this).css("display", "block");
						
						});	

						$('#page-select').val(p);

						$('#page-select').on('change', function(){
							window.location.hash = $(this).val();
						});
					}

					// function hideimages(){
					// 	$("#galmj").find("img").each(function(){
					// 		var src = $(this).attr("src");
					// 		$(this).attr("data-src", src);
					// 		$(this).removeAttr("src");
					// 		$(this).css("display", "none");
						
					// 	});	
					// }

					// hideimages();
					loadgal();

